{"productId": "9af139bf-4cee-4785-833e-96d8a824b7dc", "modelName": "1712 AV Silhouette", "modelDescription": "Anschutz rifles are simply the best of the best. With a combination of German precision engineering and superior craftsmanship these rifles are as elegant as they are accurate. The American Varminter Silhouette combines match grade accuracy with practical functionality in this .22 Long Rifle and features a threaded barrel with a counter bored crown. Suppressor ready, you can take on those varmints and predators without spooking other game. The counter bored crown on the threaded barrel is essential to maintaining the accuracy Anschutz demands from their rifles. The smooth and crisp breaking Anschutz two stage triggers are a marvel of modern engineering and are quite a treat to shoot. Sporting a warm comfortable Monte Carlo walnut stock, this rifle has the feel of a trusted classic. If you want a rifle that shoots as good as it looks, then look no further, this Anschutz 1712 AV Silhouette is the rifle for you!", "manufacturerName": "Anschutz", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "53356c02-294a-426f-a2b9-0f39d2574cbd", "description": "Anschutz, 1712 Silhouette, .22LR, Bolt Action Rifle, 21\" Barrel, 5 Rounds, Two Stage Trigger, No Sights, Monte Carlo Walnut Stock, Blued Finish\n", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a99c4604-c893-4e40-acd2-5b2116d6ce8e", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/cb6be61e-30cf-465b-9e32-d45d6f9d60b9", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/8cb82779-e49c-486a-980b-4c859b7e5028", "https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/d59fbbbc-e26d-4568-be78-4e0301d1517c"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "007594", "upc": "4046654075946", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "2765db68-a9f0-406d-8fb7-5b572b01f4ee", "attributeName": "Capacity", "attributeValueId": "89787147-cffc-4da1-8117-39428f54fd75", "valueName": "5 Round"}, {"attributeNameI